- [ ] All prop variants (size, variant, state)
- [ ] Event handlers (onClick, onChange, onFocus, etc.)
- [ ] Disabled state behavior
- [ ] Ref forwarding
- [ ] Custom className merging
- [ ] Keyboard interactions
- [ ] Accessibility attributes
